berty for such bidding is reserved, the buyer may at his option avoid the sale or take the goods at the price of the last good faith bid prior to the completion of the sale. This subsection shall not apply to any bid at a forced sale. Definitional Cross References: “Buyer”. Section 2–103. “Good faith”. Section 1–201. “Goods”. Section 2–105. “Lot”. Section 2–105. “Notice”. Section 1–202. § 2–328ARTICLE 2. SALES"